Fedora Xfce Minimal Setup
==========================

A simple bash script to automate a Fedora Xfce Minimal set up. Complete with configuration
files to build a hardened system with a stripped-down Xfce desktop.

It’s designed to build on the smallest Fedora installation possible — ideally from the
Everything ISO. Just install the "Standard" group and clone this repo to the user directory.
It’ll pull in a minimal set of Xfce and app packages, drop in some hardened configs, and
set up the user environment with dotfiles.

Any file in the 'configs' and 'dotfiles' directories can be edited, added, or removed without
touching the script. The only required file is 'applications'. The 'bloatware' file can be
safely deleted.

Fedora Everything: https://fedoraproject.org/misc#everything

Xfce Desktop Environment: https://xfce.org/

